<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: in a watery biome -->
  <AM_Water_Desired.stages.in_a_watery_biome.label>身处水源充足的生态群落中</AM_Water_Desired.stages.in_a_watery_biome.label>
  <!-- EN: Being near water fills me with peace and purpose. Its presence is a gift we must honor. -->
  <AM_Water_Desired.stages.in_a_watery_biome.description>靠近水源能让我感到平静，并坚定自己心中的目标。它的存在是我们必须敬重的恩惠。</AM_Water_Desired.stages.in_a_watery_biome.description>
  <!-- EN: in a non-watery biome -->
  <AM_Water_Desired.stages.in_a_nonwatery_biome.label>身处水源不足的生态群落中</AM_Water_Desired.stages.in_a_nonwatery_biome.label>
  <!-- EN: The absence of water weighs on my soul. This land feels barren and lifeless. -->
  <AM_Water_Desired.stages.in_a_nonwatery_biome.description>远离水源让我的灵魂变得十分沉重。这片贫瘠的土地实在是缺乏生机。</AM_Water_Desired.stages.in_a_nonwatery_biome.description>
  
</LanguageData>